   "html": "<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Primary</th><th>Secondary</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Digital involvement</td><td>Symmetry</td><td>Asymmetry</td></tr><tr><td>PAD, Digital gangrene</td><td>Absent</td><td>Present</td></tr><tr><td>Lab (ANA, ESR,…)</td><td>Normal</td><td>Abnormal</td></tr><tr><td>Other</td><td>Female, Age &lt; 40 yr</td><td>Male or Age &gt; 40 yr</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
