  {
   "id": "yb-8-3-causes",
   "h": "สาเหตุของ secondary Raynaud",
   "html": "<ul><li><b>CNT dz</b>: Systemic sclerosis, MCTD, Sjogren, SLE, PM/DM, RA, Cryoglobulinemia, Antiphospholipid</li><li><b>Arterial occlusion</b> — Vascular dz: Atherosclerosis, Buerger’s dz (Thromboangiitis Obliterans) · Micro emboli · Hypercoagulable state: PV, ET, Protein C or S deficiency, Paraproteinemia, Malignancy</li><li><b>Drug</b>: Betablocker, Ergotamine, SSZ, Cocaine</li><li><b>Other</b> — Occupation: Cold injury, PVC exposure, Vibration exposure · Metabolic: Hypothyroid, Carcinoid syndrome · Infection: CMV, HBV, HCV · Kimura dz</li></ul>"
  }
